Cindi**figleaf**To: figleafSubj: Holy Mission Picture Gallery.Cc: airborne, avron, anastasia, amethyst, baer, calvyn, cara, cougar, countvlad, creed, demolian, doolotz, dreamer, eponine, etmol, ghaklah, gorlin, gossamer, helmut, herp, iishima, jewel, jimpa, joerg, joyful, koxy, linsolent, manfred, matko, mickyfin, mikey, misticalla, morrolan, muesli, muzmuz, nae, nylakoorub, oscar, peraphon, pretzel, qwerty, redlego, redsexy, relgar, saffrin, schpankay, silas, smeghead, steerpike, sushi, tas, tegerl, thorm, tiana, tsubaki, unuscione, waldo, widge, zooeyDate: Jul 14I am mailing everyone to find out which people are still active and whicharen't. I will be removing those people who do not reply to this mail bySeptember 1st. This should be PLENTY of time.Figleaf.**tinkerbell**To: manfredSubj: legendDate: Jul 22You wife I now a legend level :)**peraphon**To: relgarSubj: Ye Official ::NETHED:: updateCc: tuppence kryten figleaf izekiel tetsuhara manfred tas quazarDate: Aug  2Ye Official ::NETHED:: Member Roster------------------------------------Current membership:---------------------Relgar - Our founder and beloved High Commander.Peraphon - Second banana and all-round nice guy.Tuppence - De Tuppimon who be our mascot, yeh.Kryten - Red Dwarf android turned mage. Smegging hell!Figleaf - Is he a member still or is he our pet wiz?Izekiel - This is the guy Conan WISHES he was.Tetsuhara - An Aussie Luke Skywalker in the making?Manfred - Has ambitions of getting to L1 and not being PK'd by Stiletto.Tas - Pure evil got a lightsaber. Be afraid.Quazar - The only PEEPing fighter/poet I know of.Membership wannabes:----------------------Copperhead - Awww, come on... ya gotta let him in :)Tinkerbell - Just waiting for her to make L1Quazar - I reckons our PEEPing friend would make a good additionMembership bans:------------------Cyclops - Cyclops = Ringlord, 'nuff said.Brainsprain - Stiletto's other char. Need we say more?Daunis - Yet another PK'erMario - Has he been wiped or what?Paranoi - Just generally being a prick (Suggested by Izekiel).Ringlord - He PK'd our beloved Tuppimon for no reason.Septian - Before wizzing, did a nasty double PK on Manfred.Stiletto - A known and uncontrolled serial PK'er, and he's proud of it.Tiana - Attempted PK on Tinkerbell (no reason). Ban until further review.Vess - Another PK'erWaldo - For trying to admit HIMSELF to our ranks!Any updates to the list, send 'em in. That includes membership contendersand people for the membership blacklist.Thanx,Pera.**peraphon**To: relgarSubj: New memberCc: tuppence figleaf kryten izekiel tetsuhara manfred tas quazar tinkerbellDate: Aug  9I have the pleasure of announcing a new member, inducted a couple of days ago by yours truly.The member is.... (drum roll).....TINKERBELL!!!!!!!I hope Tinkerbell ENJOYS her new status!!Pera.**tinkerbell**To: manfredFwd:  ::NETHED:: roster updateDate: Sep  4To: relgarSubj: ::NETHED:: roster updateCc: tuppence kryten figleaf izekiel tetsuhara manfred tas quazar tinkerbellDate: Aug  9Ye Official ::NETHED:: Member Roster------------------------------------Current membership:---------------------Relgar - Our founder and beloved High Commander.Peraphon - Second banana and all-round nice guy.Tuppence - De Tuppimon who be our mascot, yeh.Kryten - Red Dwarf android turned mage. Smegging hell!Figleaf - Is he a member still or is he our pet wiz?Izekiel - This is the guy Conan WISHES he was.Tetsuhara - An Aussie Luke Skywalker in the making?Manfred - Has ambitions of getting to L1 and not being PK'd by Stiletto.Tas - Pure evil got a lightsaber. Be afraid.Quazar - The only PEEPing fighter/poet I know of.Tinkerbell - Her name isn't very Celtic...Membership wannabes:----------------------Plenty want to be members, but whether we letthem or not is another thing entirely... :)Membership bans:------------------Cyclops - Cyclops